  "scope_statement": "Classifies an authorization payload before signing and reports how it stands against a caller-declared signing policy. Computes an EIP-712 encodeType and compares it for string equality against canonical type strings; it does not compute a domain separator, a struct hash, a digest, or recover a signer, and it never reads a chain. A check whose declared input is absent reports NOT_EVALUATED and is listed separately from the CLEAR results.",
